



>> CoffeeGrounds := ነገር አዲስ.
CoffeeGrounds ሲደርስ: ['extract'] አድርግ: { <- ['coffee']. }.

>> CoffeeMachine := ነገር አዲስ.
CoffeeMachine ሲደርስ: ['init'] አድርግ: {
	የራሱ coffeegrounds := CoffeeGrounds አዲስ.
}.
CoffeeMachine ሲደርስ: ['አዲስ'] አድርግ: { <- CoffeeMachine `new init.
}.

CoffeeMachine ሲደርስ: ['makeTea'] አድርግ: { <- (የራሱ tealeaves extract). }.
CoffeeMachine ሲደርስ: ['makeCoffee'] አድርግ: { <- (የራሱ coffeegrounds extract). }.

>> coffeeDream := CoffeeMachine አዲስ.

ውጤት ፃፍ:
	coffeeDream 
	makeCoffee.

ውጤት ፃፍ:
	coffeeDream 
	makeTea.
